        "summary": "change:20261107-itw-pwa-precache-tied-to-sw rests_on = \"InTheWake issues #1728 and #1682; measured 2026-11-07 on main 631e2a8c: manifest version 14.3.3 vs sw.js VERSION 14.3.0, /sitemap.json listed but absent, three manifest additions in May 2026 shipped with no sw.js change so installed apps never saw them, the tipping calculator not precached; sw.js normalizeRequest keeps the ?v= query, so entries must match the page's URLs exactly\"",
